<title>GERMANY: German 1997 sugar beet area put at 508,687 ha.</title>
<headline>German 1997 sugar beet area put at 508,687 ha.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's sugar beet plantings in 1997 cover 508,687 hectares, compared with 514,452 ha in 1996, sugar industry association WVZ data showed.</p>
<p>The result was based on a WVZ plantings survey, which was completed on April 15.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
